    <briefdescription>
<para>Mock clock for deterministic testing. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Provides controllable time for testing time-dependent behavior:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Manually advance time with <ref refid="classthemis_1_1utils_1_1_mock_clock_1aa896222c49c80b0376e150c2a2ac2d7e" kindref="member">advance()</ref></para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Sleep operations immediately advance mock time</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>No actual sleeping or waiting</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para>Thread Safety: This mock is NOT thread-safe. It is designed for single-threaded test scenarios where time control is explicit. Do not share <ref refid="classthemis_1_1utils_1_1_mock_clock" kindref="compound">MockClock</ref> instances across threads without external synchronization. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
